+By default only programs that use the guest's libc are path-translated; static and
+raw-syscall binaries (Go, busybox-static, ...) bypass the shim. --ptrace runs those under
+a small tracer (prxsup) that translates their paths too. It needs ptrace and seccomp on
+the host and a rootfs of the host's architecture (not qemu-user). Not a security boundary.
 
